[h2]Ahoy![/h2]

This, gentlemen, is [b]the biggest update we ever aired[/b]. Also, it’s a very special... preparation. DirectX 9, stability improvements, better AI, new features, bug fixes and so on!

Still a beta, so it’s WIP, be ye warned!ːauthorityː

